ass_tags":["内政"],"content":"3丁酉，濟南悼王廣薨；無子，國除。","content_fanyi":"丁酉日，济南悼王刘广去世；没有子嗣，封国撤除。","content_jianti_auto":"3丁酉，济南悼王广薨；无子，国除。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4548,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"96db0e25-db0e-11ef-aa68-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"安平國","place_name_jianti_auto":"安平国","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96db0e31-db0e-11ef-a297-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"96db0e32-db0e-11ef-ba47-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"安平國，屬冀州。喪，息浪翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"安平国，属冀州。丧，息浪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"96db0e30-db0e-11ef-be0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙忠","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵忠","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"96db0e35-db0e-11ef-a0fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"朱穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱穆","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"96db0e36-db0e-11ef-9cfd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"96db0e37-db0e-11ef-a20f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"不以趙忠玉匣爲僭，而以朱穆發墓爲罪，昏暗之君豈有眞是非哉！賢曰：左校，署名，屬將作，掌左工徒。校，戶敎翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"不以赵忠玉匣为僭，而以朱穆发墓为罪，昏暗之君岂有真是非哉！贤曰：左校，署名，属将作，掌左工徒。校，户教翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"96db0e34-db0e-11ef-a29f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"內官，卽中官。恚，於避翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"内官，即中官。恚，于避翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":245,"tongjian_id":"96db0e3a-db0e-11ef-b82a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96db0e3d-db0e-11ef-89e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"驩兜","people_name_jianti_auto":"驩兜","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"96db0e3e-db0e-11ef-b4c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔安国","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"96db0e3f-db0e-11ef-9674-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"帝堯","people_name_jianti_auto":"帝尧","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"96db0e40-db0e-11ef-a713-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郭璞","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭璞","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"96db0e41-db0e-11ef-9203-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"驩頭","people_name_jianti_auto":"驩头","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"96db0e42-db0e-11ef-8a30-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"驩兜","people_name_jianti_auto":"驩兜","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"96db0e43-db0e-11ef-a939-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"舜","people_name_jianti_auto":"舜","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"96db0e44-db0e-11ef-92fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"崇山","place_name_jianti_auto":"崇山","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"96db0e45-db0e-11ef-aa4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"崇山","place_name_jianti_auto":"崇山","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"96db0e46-db0e-11ef-83cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"驩頭","place_name_jianti_auto":"驩头","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"96db0e47-db0e-11ef-a0ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒼梧","place_name_jianti_auto":"苍梧","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"96db0e48-db0e-11ef-a77a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：尚書：放驩兜於崇山。孔安國註曰：崇山，南裔也。山海經曰：有驩頭之國，帝堯葬焉。郭璞註曰：驩頭，驩兜也。禮記曰：舜葬蒼梧之野。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：尚书：放驩兜于崇山。孔安国注曰：崇山，南裔也。山海经曰：有驩头之国，帝尧葬焉。郭璞注曰：驩头，驩兜也。礼记曰：舜葬苍梧之野。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":308,"tongjian_id":"96db0e3c-db0e-11ef-8312-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"天憲，王法也；謂刑戮出於其口也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"天宪，王法也；谓刑戮出于其口也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":330,"tongjian_id":"96db0e4e-db0e-11ef-9df8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96db0e50-db0e-11ef-9845-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"季氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"季氏","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"96db0e51-db0e-11ef-8f69-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"96db0e52-db0e-11ef-bcf0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：運，行也。論語曰：季氏富於周公。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：运，行也。论语曰：季氏富于周公。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":341,"tongjian_id":"96db0e4f-db0e-11ef-808a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"噏，與吸同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"噏，与吸同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":354,"tongjian_id":"96db0e54-db0e-11ef-a57d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_ind