州刺史是汉代地方行政长官，掌管冀州政务，此处朱穆被任命此职，负责治理冀州并弹劾贪官。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"詔以侍御史朱穆爲冀州刺史","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"d5fac737-92e9-4a24-83a1-aa31451864c2"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"令長","official_note":"令長是汉代县级行政长官，此处指冀州下属的县令和县长，因畏惧朱穆的严厉而辞职。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"冀部令長聞穆濟河，解印綬去者四十餘人","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"115cfd5e-96f7-4e81-8125-e7d87bf86ab6"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"司法","official_name":"廷尉","official_note":"廷尉是汉代最高司法官员，负责审理重大案件，此处朱穆被召至廷尉受审，显示其因弹劾宦官而获罪。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"帝聞，大怒，徵穆詣廷尉，輸作左校","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"905bd353-0845-425a-9b50-82a3c5ad3b31"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"军事或劳役","official_name":"左校","official_note":"左校是汉代官署，负责管理刑徒劳役，此处朱穆被罚在此处服劳役，作为对其弹劾行为的惩罚。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"徵穆詣廷尉，輸作左校","start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"74366567-5444-4961-96b4-0384f94ac2e8"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"常侍","official_note":"常侍是汉代宦官官职，常侍皇帝左右，此处指宦官赵忠等，他们权势显赫，在地方作恶，是朱穆弹劾的对象。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"誠以常侍貴寵，父子兄弟布在州郡，競爲虎狼，噬食小民","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"1036d2de-34c5-47b0-87a5-4c5e7eac3bca"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"中官","official_note":"中官泛指汉代宦官，此处指宦官集团掌握国家大权，是刘陶上书批评的对象，与朱穆的弹劾事件相关。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"當今中官近習，竊持國柄，手握王爵，口銜天憲","start_index":312,"tongjian_id":"40522ac1-7a4c-4eee-8980-1e29b3995844"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"朱穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"96db0e5f-db0e-11ef-870e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"96db0e60-db0e-11ef-9d27-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":189,"link_td_description":"赵忠，冀州安平人，东汉灵帝时期“十常侍”之一。","link_td_id":"Q10004851","link_td_number_id":465293,"people_name":"趙忠","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵忠","people_xingming":"赵忠","start_index":90,"tongjian_id":"96db0e65-db0e-11ef-887c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d6e-db0e-11ef-9256-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d6f-db0e-11ef-829e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":185,"link_td_description":"刘陶，又名刘伟，字子奇，颍川颍阴人，东汉名臣，西汉济北贞王刘勃之后，官至谏议大夫，后被宦官诬陷下狱而自尽。","link_td_id":"Q10016926","link_td_number_id":4429767,"people_name":"劉陶","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘陶","people_xingming":"刘陶","start_index":150,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d70-db0e-11ef-8bff-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":161,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d71-db0e-11ef-b805-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"朱穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":170,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d72-db0e-11ef-b3e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":215,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d74-db0e-11ef-a726-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":272,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d75-db0e-11ef-bd9d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"禹，姒姓，夏后氏，传说名文命，后世尊称为大禹。远古时期中国神话人物，是黄帝轩辕氏八世孙，因在大禹治水中成功治理洪水之患的故事而广为人知。传说中，禹是中国历史上第一个家天下政权夏朝的开创者，定都于阳城（具体所在有多种说法）。禹在尧时被封为夏伯，故史书又称伯禹、夏禹。在道教信仰里，禹也被尊为水官大帝、水仙尊王。","link_td_id":"Q10000013","link_td_number_id":4218,"people_name":"禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"禹","people_xingming":"禹","start_index":275,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d76-db0e-11ef-8634-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"稷","people_name_jianti_auto":"稷","people_xingming":"稷","start_index":277,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d77-db0e-11ef-a4fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"共","people_name_jianti_auto":"共","people_xingming":"共工","start_index":280,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d78-db0e-11ef-ad68-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"鲧，字熙，大禹之父，封崇伯，又称崇伯鲧。","link_td_id":"Q10001692","link_td_number_id":9951,"people_name":"鯀","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲧","people_xingming":"鲧","start_index":282,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d79-db0e-11ef-b472-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"尧，祁姓，名放勋，中国神话中五帝之一，传说出生于三阿之南。道教中为天官大帝，三官大帝之一，诞日为上元节。","link_td_id":"Q10000026","link_td_number_id":14183,"people_name":"唐帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"唐帝","people_xingming":"唐尧帝","start_index":293,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d7a-db0e-11ef-b971-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[伊祁放勋]"},{"link_td_description":"舜，中国上古时代的五帝之一，东夷人。亦是道教与民间信仰的地官大帝。名重华；生于姚墟，为姚姓，后居于妫水之边，后人将姚姓改为妫姓，有虞氏。冀州人，都城在蒲阪（今山西永济）。舜为四部落联盟首领，以受尧的「禅让」而称帝于天下，其国号为「有虞」。","link_td_id":"Q10000010","link_td_number_id":4332,"people_name":"重華","people_name_jianti_auto":"重华","people_xingming":"虞舜帝","start_index":300,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d7b-db0e-11ef-aaac-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[姚重华]"},{"people_name":"季孫","people_name_jianti_auto":"季孙","people_xingming":"季孙","start_index":338,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d7e-db0e-11ef-8bbb-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[姬友]"},{"link_birth_year":-1649,"link_death_year":-1549,"link_td_description":"伊尹，姒姓，伊氏，名挚，建立商朝的重要名臣、政治家。","link_td_id":"Q10008146","link_td_number_id":109452,"people_name":"伊","people_name_jianti_auto":"伊","people_xingming":"伊尹","start_index":345,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d7f-db0e-11ef-a16b-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[伊尹]"},{"link_birth_year":-521,"link_death_year":-481,"link_td_description":"颜回，曹姓，颜氏，字子渊，又称颜子、颜渊。唐代为避李渊名讳，曾改其字为子泉。春秋鲁国人。孔子七十二门徒之首。孔门十哲中德行科之一。被视作孔子最得意的弟子，位居孔门第一位。家境贫穷，但能安贫乐道；为人聪敏、好学、不贰过、闻一知十；品行优越，孔子称赞其贤德，是孔子心法传承的直系弟子，但年仅四十岁就去世了，后世尊称为“复圣”。","link_td_id":"Q10000187","link_td_number_id":11634,"people_name":"顏","people_name_jianti_auto":"颜","people_xingming":"颜渊","start_index":347,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d80-db0e-11ef-84ff-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[颜渊]"},{"link_td_description":"桀，姒姓，夏后氏，名履癸，又称夏桀，中国夏朝第十七任君主，亦是最后一任君主。发之子。","link_td_id":"Q10000065","link_td_number_id":31722,"people_name":"桀","people_name_jianti_auto":"桀","people_xingming":"桀","start_index":350,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d81-db0e-11ef-b225-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[子受辛]"},{"link_td_description":"盗跖，春秋时期人物，姬姓，展氏，名跖，一作蹠。传说中的大盗，鲁国大夫柳下惠之弟，率领盗匪数千人，人称“盗跖”，与楚国大盗庄蹻齐名。","link_td_id":"Q10001139","link_td_number_id":706129,"people_name":"跖","people_name_jianti_auto":"跖","people_xingming":"盗跖","start_index":352,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d82-db0e-11ef-bc41-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[盗跖]"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":355,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d83-db0e-11ef-b354-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","people_xingming":"朱穆","start_index":412,"tongjian_id":"96dd61a8-db0e-11ef-9722-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"96db0e2d-db0e-11ef-b2b7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"huì","source_anchor_text":"內官咸共恚疾謗讟煩","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":242,"text":"恚","tongjian_id":"f72cd99c-0cea-5fbc-b62e-d52f188e9d9c"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"96db0e2d-db0e-11ef-b2b7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dú","source_anchor_text":"共恚疾謗讟煩興讒隙","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":246,"text":"讟","tongjian_id":"bae67b53-7977-58d6-8e78-74963d8a3116"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"96db0e2d-db0e-11ef-b2b7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhé","source_anchor_text":"作極其刑讁輸作左校","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":258,"text":"讁","tongjian_id":"cb94fb97-461c-51dc-84f2-1695136dd431"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"96db0e2d-db0e-11ef-b2b7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"gǔn","source_anchor_text":"稷而被共鯀之戾若死","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":282,"text":"鯀","tongjian_id":"d8c2a7c6-eb9a-5bff-80ed-968d18565625"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"96db0e2d-db0e-11ef-b2b7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xī","source_anchor_text":"於季孫呼噏則令伊顏","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":342,"text":"噏","tongjian_id":"7598a72d-4aef-5cea-8e6b-2e8680fb9a6e"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河水","place_name_jianti_auto":"河水","resolved_place_entity_id":42,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"96db0e5e-db0e-11ef-8020-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","resolved_place_entity_id":216,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"96db0e61-db0e-11ef-a7f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","resolved_place_entity_id":216,"start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"96db0e62-db0e-11ef-a067-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀部","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀部","resolved_place_entity_id":216,"start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"96db0e63-db0e-11ef-a957-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","resolved_place_entity_id":42,"start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"96db0e64-db0e-11ef-9a8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安平","place_name_jianti_auto":"安平","resolved_place_entity_id":1559,"start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"96db0e66-db0e-11ef-8040-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川","resolved_place_entity_id":337,"start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d73-db0e-11ef-9179-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"崇山","place_name_jianti_auto":"崇山","resolved_place_entity_id":6775,"start_index":297,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d7c-db0e-11ef-9539-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒼","place_name_jianti_auto":"苍","resolved_place_entity_id":8988,"start_index":304,"tongjian_id":"96dc9d7d-db0e-11ef-adcb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事","权争"],"content":"4秋，七月，郡、國三十二蝗，河水溢。百姓饑窮流宂者數十萬戶，冀州尤甚。詔以侍御史朱穆爲冀州刺史。冀部令長聞穆濟河，解印綬去者四十餘人。及到，奏劾諸郡貪汙者，有至自殺，或死獄中。宦者趙忠喪父，歸葬安平，僭爲玉匣；穆下郡案驗，吏畏其嚴，遂發墓剖棺，陳尸出之。帝聞，大怒，徵穆詣廷尉，輸作左校。太學書生潁川劉陶等數千人詣闕上書訟穆曰：「伏見弛刑徒朱穆，處公憂國，拜州之日，志清姦惡。誠以常侍貴寵，父子兄弟布在州郡，競爲虎狼，噬食小民，故穆張理天綱，補綴漏目，羅取殘禍，以塞天意。由是內官咸共恚疾，謗讟煩興，讒隙仍作，極其刑讁，輸作左校。天下有識，皆以穆同勤禹、稷而被共、鯀之戾，若死者有知，則唐帝怒於崇山，重華忿於蒼墓矣！當今中官近習，竊持國柄，手握王爵，口銜天憲，運賞則使餓隸富於季孫，呼噏則令伊、顏化爲桀、跖；而穆獨亢然不顧身害，非惡榮而好辱，惡生而好死也，徒感王綱之不攝，懼天綱之久失，故竭心懷憂，爲上深計。臣願黥首繫趾，代穆輸作。」帝覽其奏，乃赦之。","content_fanyi":"秋季七月，三十二个郡、国发生蝗灾，黄河水漫溢。百姓中饥饿穷困、流离失所的有数十万户，冀州尤为严重。朝廷下诏任命侍御史朱穆为冀州刺史。冀州境内的县令、县长听说朱穆渡过黄河，便解下印绶自动离职而去的有四十多人。朱穆到任以后，上奏弹劾各郡的贪污官吏，其中有的甚至自杀，有的死在狱中。宦官赵忠的父亲去世，归葬安平国，赵忠却超越礼制用玉匣装殓；朱穆下令郡中查核此事，郡吏畏惧他严厉，于是掘开坟墓、劈开棺木，把尸体抬出来查验。桓帝听说后大怒，将朱穆召交廷尉，处以输作左校的刑罚。太学生、颍川人刘陶等数千人来到宫门前上书为朱穆申诉说：“我们私下看到身为弛刑徒的朱穆，存心公正、忧念国事，受任冀州刺史那天，就立志肃清奸恶。确实因为中常侍地位尊贵、受到宠信，他们的父子兄弟遍布州郡，争相像虎狼一样吞噬小民，所以朱穆才伸张国家法纪，补缀法网漏洞，搜捕残害百姓的祸害，以顺应天意。因此宦官们全都憎恨他，诽谤责难纷纷出现，谗言嫌隙不断发生，最终用严厉刑罚加以贬谪，发配到左校服苦役。天下有识之士，都认为朱穆像禹、后稷一样勤于国事，却遭受共工、鲧那样的惩罚，如果死者有知觉，那么唐尧会在崇山发怒，虞舜也会在苍梧之墓中愤恨！如今宦官和亲近之臣，窃据国家权柄，手握封爵大权，口含天子法令，行赏时能让饥饿的奴隶比季孙氏还富，呼吸之间又能让伊尹、颜渊变成桀、盗跖；而朱穆独自昂然不顾自身祸害，并不是厌恶荣耀而喜欢羞辱，厌恶生命而喜欢死亡，只是因为痛感朝廷纲纪得不到整肃，担心国家法度长久废弛，所以尽心忧劳，为皇上深谋远虑。我们甘愿身受黥面、脚系镣铐之刑，代替朱穆去服苦役。”桓帝看了奏书，便赦免了朱穆。","content_jianti_auto":"4秋，七月，郡、国三十二蝗，河水溢。百姓饥穷流宂者数十万户，冀州尤甚。诏以侍御史朱穆为冀州刺史。冀部令长闻穆济河，解印绶去者四十余人。及到，奏劾诸郡贪污者，有至自杀，或死狱中。宦者赵忠丧父，归葬安平，僭为玉匣；穆下郡案验，吏畏其严，遂发墓剖棺，陈尸出之。帝闻，大怒，征穆诣廷尉，输作左校。太学书生颍川刘陶等数千人诣阙上书讼穆曰：「伏见弛刑徒朱穆，处公忧国，拜州之日，志清奸恶。诚以常侍贵宠，父子兄弟布在州郡，竞为虎狼，噬食小民，故穆张理天纲，补缀漏目，罗取残祸，以塞天意。由是内官咸共恚疾，谤讟烦兴，谗隙仍作，极其刑讁，输作左校。天下有识，皆以穆同勤禹、稷而被共、鲧之戾，若死者有知，则唐帝怒于崇山，重华忿于苍墓矣！当今中官近习，窃持国柄，手握王爵，口衔天宪，运赏则使饿隶富于季孙，呼噏则令伊、颜化为桀、跖；而穆独亢然不顾身害，非恶荣而好辱，恶生而好死也，徒感王纲之不摄，惧天纲之久失，故竭心怀忧，为上深计。臣愿黥首系趾，代穆输作。」帝览其奏，乃赦之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4549,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"96db0e2d-db0e-11ef-b2b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"太尉","official_note":"太尉是汉代三公之一，掌管全国军事，此处表示袁汤被免去太尉职务。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"太尉袁湯免","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"f20ebe31-1824-4e37-b7dc-b11f87ce2f09"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太常","official_note":"太常是九卿之一，掌管宗庙礼仪和祭祀，此处胡广由太常升任太尉。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"以太常胡廣爲太尉","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"21b96cd7-3751-4238-a67b-9bf80e3e75f8"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"太尉","official_note":"太尉是汉代三公之一，掌管全国军事，此处胡广被任命为太尉。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"以太常胡廣爲太尉","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"c52e707a-fb8b-40d6-9e7d-db62ddfa0598"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"司徒","official_note":"司徒是汉代三公之一，掌管民政和教化，此处表示吴雄被免去司徒职务。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"司徒吳雄、司空趙戒免","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"3d87f24f-ae9f-4f77-883f-8f2b841db3a5"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"司空","official_note":"司空是汉代三公之一，掌管水土工程和监察，此处表示赵戒被免去司空职务。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"司徒吳雄、司空趙戒免","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"6762f5a7-2b43-4f28-b237-ca53e890dfe2"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"财政","official_name":"太僕","official_note":"太僕是九卿之一，掌管皇帝车马和畜牧业，此处黄琼由太僕升任司徒。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"以太僕黃瓊爲司徒","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"87990b0f-aac0-4243-abfb-b1161222c3b2"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"司徒","official_note":"司徒是汉代三公之一，掌管民政和教化，此处黄琼被任命为司徒。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"以太僕黃瓊爲司徒","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b8acb7f9-671c-40ff-b373-247a0c7bf017"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"光祿勳","official_note":"光祿勳是九卿之一，掌管宫殿门户和侍卫，此处房植由光祿勳升任司空。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"光祿勳房植爲司空","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"f8271dcd-c546-4da2-9b32-b2f47ddf3deb"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"司空","official_note":"司空是汉代三公之一，掌管水土工程和监察，此处房植被任命为司空。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"光祿勳房植爲司空","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"ab808245-417b-40bb-8533-2a4f62b9862b"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"袁汤，字仲河，汝南郡汝阳县（今河南商水西南）人。中国东汉时期官员，出身汝南袁氏，为东汉名臣袁安之孙。袁汤在东汉历任司空、司徒、太尉高位。袁汤亦是东汉末年的军阀袁术及袁绍的祖父。","link_td_id":"Q10003595","link_td_number_id":3653875,"people_name":"袁湯","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁汤","people_xingming":"袁汤","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"96dd61aa-db0e-11ef-9fbe-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":91,"link_death_year":172,"link_td_description":"胡广，字伯始，南郡华容（今湖北省监利市）人，东汉中期大臣。","link_td_id":"Q10007243","link_td_number_id":1556737,"people_name":"胡廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"胡广","people_xingming":"胡广","start_index":15,"tongj